{"type":"text","timestamp":1790402673835,"sessionID":"ses_f23aff56cffePS851e9BNxB94L","part":{"id":"prt_0dc50bc8e001TT2xxnpIJocMBB","messageID":"msg_0dc50811f001jXKkckGlVHlXOW","sessionID":"ses_f23aff56cffePS851e9BNxB94L","type":"text","text":"The existing collision scheme already assigns battle units to layers 1 and 2 by team, so the requested detect-layer/mask formulas fit directly. I’ll add the two reusable nodes, wire exported node references in the scene, and initialize detection only after the duplicated unit stats are available.","time":{"start":1790402673806,"end":1790402673810},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00671f3bf9858b4c016ab76070cc208190be8c35ce0c3aa959","phase":"commentary"}}}}
